  "summary": "Malformed RowDescription and DataRow messages cause panics in github.com/lib/pq",
  "details": "github.com/lib/pq decodes attacker-controlled RowDescription and DataRow payloads without validating their structural relationship or encoded value widths required by binary decoders. A malicious PostgreSQL endpoint or active network attacker on an unauthenticated transport can send malformed row responses, causing unrecovered runtime panics while reading query results.",
